"""Deprecated stub — real tests live in institutions/tests/.

This file's only original content was the Django auto-generated
`from django.test import TestCase`. After tier-4 §2 added
`institutions/tests/` as a test package, pytest can't collect
both this file and the package at the same time. The package
wins; this file is kept as a placeholder so the empty stub
isn't restored if someone runs `django-admin startapp` later.

Pytest's collector ignores files that don't start with `test_`,
so this name preserves the placeholder without re-introducing
the collection collision.
"""